{"id":"xfzpyc1vc5vyzit23cmxl9s09","title":"CERN 为 HL-LHC 研发下一代超导磁体技术","originalTitle":"CERN 如何为 LHC 研发下一代磁体","summary":"CERN 公布 HL-LHC 升级计划，目标将磁体磁场强度从 8.3 T 提升至 12 T。当前 LHC 磁体采用铌钛合金线圈，磁场强度已达地球磁场的 16.6 万倍且无法突破。铌锡化合物线圈有望实现更高磁场强度，提升每秒 60 万次粒子碰撞至 140-200 万次，增强观测罕见粒子或特殊物理现象的能力。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"奇客 Solidot"},"links":{"original":"https://www.solidot.org/story?sid=85856"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T08:20:35.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T09:43:21.942Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T09:43:21.942Z","category":"quantum-physics","tags":["研究成果"],"score":58,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"0ecb2eda-c117-47ec-8446-95ccb7cd7af0","title":"CERN推进HL-LHC磁体升级至12T"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"0ecb2eda-c117-47ec-8446-95ccb7cd7af0","title":"CERN推进HL-LHC磁体升级至12T"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fNqNjCwk5OkE","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}